{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "81aef0c2ee5c29b1b71ba87eed69f76071e5580c98994ba17bf51c2cf6b0ad01", "ja": "撮影開始！　～劇場の日々～", "zh": "拍摄开始！ ～剧场的日常～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0fbcf9640293610459b9523f489a9a6f712f78aedbd3cdc5a7e675f1dd591707", "ja": "記念公演に沸く劇場……祝うべき日を迎える\nため、アイドル達も裏方も、何ヶ月にも渡っ\nて準備してきた。この映像はそんな毎日を映\nしたドキュメンタリー！　まずは社長と事務\n員達による、会場の下見のシーンから。", "zh": "剧场里洋溢着纪念公演的热烈气氛……为了迎接\n值得庆祝的日子，偶像们和幕后工作人员都准备了\n好几个月。这段影像记录的就是这样的每一天，\n是一部纪录片！首先，让我们从社长和事务员们\n视察会场的场景开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "5bf36d811b8dd8e4967c38863e6e9963f979828af6f7e7ff2536ef4cbc9bb0b6", "ja": "記念公演より遡ること数ヶ月、\nまだ肌寒いある日のこと……", "zh": "在纪念公演前几个月，某个依旧有些寒冷的日子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "2a823823c106b4f4b6e0de6373fd05a0ae73a508f2fb4651c2aa1b7a30e728b8", "ja": "765プロダクション社長、高木順二朗の朝は早い。\n記念公演のため、ライブ会場の下見に……", "zh": "765事务所社长高木顺二朗的早晨总是很早。\n为了纪念公演，他前去实地考察演出场地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_1002_president", "source_sha256": "2dda045d6c9c135ff2b98254a47abeec68f228e0decd2801e05786dc58418c97", "ja": "……うーん、もう少し右かな。\n君！　もう少し右にカメラを振って。", "zh": "……唔——再往右一点吧。\n你！镜头再往右边移一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "048a13cdd968276a28919db300c785b9c7255ed7086782f8a9c8de1ffd46a095", "ja": "あ、ええと……こうですか？", "zh": "啊，呃……这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_1004_president", "source_sha256": "387adc763101288c4aa84fafa27ea7a46f98487f5c27a96480dfb0509a8efc33", "ja": "いやいや、ただカメラを動かすだけではダメだよ！\nもっとこう、情熱的に演出してくれたまえ！", "zh": "不不不，只是移动镜头可不行啊！\n要更加、怎么说呢，热情地去执导表现才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_1005_president", "source_sha256": "8d6c52db7621bef19bea0d569dcaac25a64aed8de6f6f685a71f3a86c8b017f1", "ja": "君は今、記念公演をバリバリ盛り上げる、\nドキュメンタリーVTRを撮っているんだよ。", "zh": "你现在正在拍摄一部\n能让纪念演出气氛大涨的纪录片VTR哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_1006_president", "source_sha256": "79065c8141a98f0a2f8e8df8ee0d8bd4edb5377433eee69fd95cc4ca353923ad", "ja": "わかるかね？　これは芸術なんだ！\nアカデミー賞ものの大作を撮ってもらわないと困るよ。", "zh": "明白吗？这可是艺术啊！\n不拍出一部奥斯卡级别的大作可就难办了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d6f1215658059600ad05ff9d47ee80f39d104f26ab5685371b5accb146fd4f9d", "ja": "はあ、芸術ですか。", "zh": "唉，艺术吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "0c982a6db1d0c24ec6a57860c63666a2bea4839e1602944e112c8d8319b3f228", "ja": "記念公演でドキュメンタリーVTRを流すなんて、\nワクワクしますね♪　お客さんの反応が楽しみです！", "zh": "居然要在纪念公演上播放纪录片影像，\n真让人兴奋♪　真期待客人们的反应！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "5015da2569e49604293a48378596309ce672bb2abb628ca291a0a2804468178a", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お忙しいでしょうけど、\nカメラマンをよろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，虽然您很忙，\n但摄影师的工作就拜托您了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_1010", "source_sha256": "59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34", "ja": "わかりました！", "zh": "我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "e1ba7eb224dc9a4d8815367ef18f2d74f427d17d4a796ffecca223d2fe20229f", "ja": "任せてください！　アイドル達はもちろんですけど、\n青羽さんや音無さんも、しっかり撮りますね！", "zh": "交给我吧！偶像们当然没问题，青羽小姐和音无小姐我也会好好拍的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2001_101kot", "source_sha256": "f20ec815a31c9988c8e3ebe048c3d1b2a9d15e05218cdaa7235259063d67b470", "ja": "うふふ、ありがとうございます♪\n今日はメイクもキメてきましたから、幾らでも……。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你♪\n我今天妆也化得特别用心，想拍多少都没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "50520a1dde519d2ae7613c152836f4d2d275f054ff84f14416865e79af7bb2aa", "ja": "ああ、いいアングルを見つけた。\n君！　ここからのカットはどうだろう。", "zh": "啊，找到一个不错的角度。\n你！从这里拍的画面怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "8b1bf7c08b79464d11f5d0cce62ee70ec1d9d89060386873c73ac7e0835b7a0c", "ja": "あ、はい！　今行きます！", "zh": "啊，好的！现在就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "eb21a73a9a377b9874d1436547d6861122f306eb409f23f2a31176925966720e", "ja": "ピヨッ！？", "zh": "啾！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2005_president", "source_sha256": "b2dd9518f590514341bc4181a8d36712381174291d0f63ae7cd10c4590518e47", "ja": "どうかね？　いい会場だと思わないかね？　ここなら、\n未来に向けて歩き出す、強い意志が表現できそうだ。", "zh": "怎么样？不觉得这是个很棒的会场吗？在这里，应该能表现出迈向未来的坚定意志。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2006_president", "source_sha256": "04d16a8c44273a494f8690fe0ceab0b3f4dd80f03019dab330845e638f1c9ded", "ja": "今はこうして静かだが、目を閉じれば、\nライブの熱が、ありありと想像できてくる……。", "zh": "现在虽然像这样安静，但只要闭上眼睛，\n现场演出的热烈气氛就会鲜明地浮现出来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2007_president", "source_sha256": "58dda92a2195ee4c7bf766abb42be592aadbfc113911faae0dbeff068fbc7ea0", "ja": "今のアイドル諸君にはぴったりの会場だと思うが、\nどうかね？", "zh": "我觉得这会场很适合现在的偶像们，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2008_p", "source_sha256": "ce10fe9f79f91f9573449203b991089b3da650f0dee46716fa15302710cb322b", "ja": "はい、そう思います！\nこの会場を使うなら、面白いライブになりそうですね。", "zh": "是的，我也这么认为！\n如果使用这个会场，应该会成为一场很有意思的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2009_president", "source_sha256": "7967797687629eb6cc876e2ba95562a1a1fccb9a56d5180464b613a3859f1c9b", "ja": "よし、ではここに決めよう！\n後の事は頼んだよ。手続きや、そのカメラの撮影もね。", "zh": "好，那就定在这里吧！\n之后的事就拜托你了。手续，还有用那台相机拍摄的事也交给你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2010_president", "source_sha256": "df6f1e0798ece01ddc19d03e7be6d756925cde057bd01a362a03680514e8205e", "ja": "ひとりひとり、『主人公』としてステージに立つ\nアイドル達の輝き……しっかりと収めてくれたまえ！", "zh": "让每一位偶像都作为“主角”站上舞台，\n将她们的光芒……好好记录下来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2011_null", "source_sha256": "75d4a2150abc8ea12f8777e0390c16d87e7ba6b4cc73185cedb3d28f1899df26", "ja": "こうして、記念公演に向けて、\n765プロライブシアターは動き出した……。", "zh": "就这样，为了纪念公演，765专业现场剧场开始运转了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2012_null", "source_sha256": "0a6faf4b77648cf1dcc4025bbf7a5ba65855e5a51375ca75b29e67b8707ca438", "ja": "これは、記念すべき日に向けた、アイドルたちと\n関係者たちの、忙しくも輝かしい日々の記録である！", "zh": "这是偶像们与相关人员为迎接值得纪念的日子而度过的、忙碌却又闪耀的日常记录！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_intro_2013_null", "source_sha256": "64ca012f2bded3feb36029810a2685fe9c0c856e094e3bbe289d768690625341", "ja": "（撮影・ナレーション担当：{$P$}）", "zh": "（拍摄、旁白负责人：{$P$}）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
